WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
From tabletop, walk the hands forward and keep the hips stacked over the knees.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Allow the chest to melt toward the floor.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Forehead or chin can rest on a block.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Breathe into the upper back.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Walk the hands back to tabletop to exit.
